+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know the passive with *ser* + past participle from B1 Unit 18: *La ley fue aprobada por el Parlamento*. The participle agrees with the subject, and *por* names who did the action. It suits the history of tango, where it matters who brought, sang or declared what."
     },
