+          "plural subject: *fueron cantados*"
         ],
         [
-          "Llegados los inmigrantes al puerto, iniciaba el riguroso examen sanitario.",
-          "Having the immigrants arrived at the port, the rigorous health inspection would begin."
+          "El tango fue declarado Patrimonio por la UNESCO.",
+          "the actor is named with *por*"
         ]
       ]
