+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *sin embargo* and *no obstante* from B1 Unit 1, and *aunque* from A2 Unit 28. They set one fact against another: something is true, and yet something unexpected is also true. A dry valley full of life is a perfect example."
